cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation)
  and, if you refer to the code itself, this repository.
type: software
title: >-
  Reproducibility code for "Optimal Execution with Reinforcement Learning in a
  Multi-Agent Market Simulator"
abstract: >-
  ABIDES-based Gym environment, DQN training scripts, hand-crafted execution
  baselines (TWAP, Passive, Random) and evaluation/figure scripts reproducing
  Hafsi and Vittori (ACDSA 2026). Built on the ABIDES simulator (J.P. Morgan
  Chase 2021, Georgia Tech Research Corporation 2019).
